        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "The House of the Dead III",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The House of the Dead III is a 2002 light gun arcade game with a horror zombie-survival theme, and the third installment to the House of the Dead series of video games, developed by Wow Entertainment and Sega. It was later ported to the Xbox in 2003, Microsoft Windows in 2005, the Wii in 2008 in a compilation with The House of the Dead 2, and PlayStation 3 in 2012 with PlayStation Move support. The game continues the story of the previous games and introduces new gameplay concepts such as story branching. The game's protagonist is Lisa Rogan, daughter of Thomas Rogan, the first game's main character, and players control Lisa, G, or Daniel Curien.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The House of the Dead III es un juego arcade de disparo con pistola de luz de 2002, con temática de terror y supervivencia contra zombis. Es la tercera entrega de la serie de videojuegos The House of the Dead, desarrollada por Wow Entertainment y Sega. Posteriormente se adaptó a Xbox en 2003, a Microsoft Windows en 2005, a Wii en 2008 en una recopilación junto a The House of the Dead 2, y a PlayStation 3 en 2012 con soporte para PlayStation Move. El juego continúa la historia de los anteriores e introduce nuevos conceptos de jugabilidad, como las ramificaciones de la historia. La protagonista es Lisa Rogan, hija de Thomas Rogan, el personaje principal del primer juego, y los jugadores controlan a Lisa, G o Daniel Curien.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2002",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
